        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "G. The University retains the right to enforce access rules and regulations in accordance with local campus procedures. The types of sanctions which may be imposed upon the Union as a result of a University determination that an access rule or regulation has been violated include, but are not limited to:",
